{% comment %} Privacy Policy {% endcomment %}
<div class="policy-page">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="policy-date">Last updated: {{ 'now' | date: '%B %d, %Y' }}</p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We collect the following information when you place an order:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Name and mobile number</li>
    <li>Delivery address</li>
    <li>Order history and preferences</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not collect or store your payment card details. Payments are handled by Razorpay.</p>

  <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To process and deliver your orders</li>
    <li>To send order confirmations and delivery updates via SMS</li>
    <li>To improve our products and services</li>
    <li>To send payment reminders for outstanding invoices</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal data. We share your information only with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Razorpay</strong> — for payment processing</li>
    <li><strong>Delivery partners</strong> — for order fulfilment</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Data Storage</h2>
  <p>Your data is stored securely on Supabase (hosted on AWS). We retain order data for up to 3 years for accounting purposes.</p>

  <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
  <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any time by contacting us at <a href="mailto:hello@thegoodpapaya.com">hello@thegoodpapaya.com</a>.</p>

  <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use minimal cookies to maintain your shopping cart session. We do not use tracking or advertising cookies.</p>

  <h2>7. Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy-related queries, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@thegoodpapaya.com">hello@thegoodpapaya.com</a>.</p>
</div>
